<title>THAILAND: Thai Feb C/A deficit narrows.</title>
<headline>Thai Feb C/A deficit narrows.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's February current account deficit narrowed to a preliminary 14.7 billion baht from 22.5 billion baht deficit in January, the Bank of Thailand said on Thursday.</p>
<p>    C/A DEFICIT	   Feb 97	 Jan 97	 Feb 96</p>
<p>				 14.7	  22.5	  23.4</p>
<p>Note - Figures in billions of baht. January figure was revised.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 6520642</p>
